    outlines, so it looks the same whatever fonts the viewer has. Static copies
    for places that can't inline SVG live in public/img/logo(-dark).{svg,png}.

    Size it with `height` (any CSS length) — set inline, not via a Tailwind
    utility, so it can't silently collapse when the CSS bundle is stale.
--}}
